Feature: Indicator Showcase - SMA breakout with momentum and volatility envelope
  Primary timeframe: 1h
  Parameter sma_fast default 20
  Parameter sma_slow default 100
  Parameter macd_fast default 12
  Parameter macd_slow default 26
  Parameter macd_sig default 9
  Parameter atr_period default 14
  Parameter vol_period default 20
  Parameter range_period default 50
  Parameter stop_loss_pct default 1.5

  Background:
    Given a series fast defined as sma(sma_fast)
    And a series slow defined as sma(sma_slow)
    And a series hist defined as macd_histogram(macd_fast, macd_slow, macd_sig)
    And a series atr_val defined as atr(atr_period)
    And a series vol_band defined as stddev(vol_period)
    And a series range_high defined as highest_high(range_period)
    And a series range_low defined as lowest_low(range_period)
    And a series swing_high defined as highest_close(range_period)
    And a series swing_low defined as lowest_close(range_period)

  Scenario: Enter long on close break above fast in uptrend
    Given no open position
    When close crosses above fast
    And fast is above slow
    And hist is above 0
    Then long_entry
    And with stop_loss at entry_price * (1 - stop_loss_pct / 100)

  Scenario: Exit long on close break below fast
    Given a long position is open
    When close crosses below fast
    Then long_exit

  Scenario: Enter short on close break below fast in downtrend
    Given no open position
    When close crosses below fast
    And fast is below slow
    And hist is below 0
    Then short_entry
    And with stop_loss at entry_price * (1 + stop_loss_pct / 100)

  Scenario: Exit short on close break above fast
    Given a short position is open
    When close crosses above fast
    Then short_exit
